---

This product implements the appliance-side (HNA role) application protocol
described by CNS 16014, a publicly available national standard of Taiwan.

This repository contains no text, tables, or figures reproduced from CNS 16014
or CNS 16090. In particular it deliberately contains no copy of the per-
appliance service tables (CNS 16014 Annex A): appliance capabilities are
queried from the appliance at run time instead. Interpreting the meaning of a
service identifier is the consumer's responsibility, using its own licensed
copy of the standard.

This product is not certified, endorsed, or verified by any standards body,
and no claim of conformance to CNS 16014 or CNS 16090 is made.
